194
00:07:21,837 --> 00:07:24,987
In the second quarter of twenty twenty-six

195
00:07:24,987 --> 00:07:27,613
it was already the world's fourth largest

196
00:07:27,613 --> 00:07:28,637
DRAM maker,

197
00:07:28,637 --> 00:07:30,999
with about nine and a half percent

198
00:07:30,999 --> 00:07:32,387
