199
00:07:32,637 --> 00:07:35,583
In July twenty twenty-six it listed its

200
00:07:35,583 --> 00:07:38,038
shares in Shanghai and raised at least

201
00:07:38,038 --> 00:07:40,357
eight point six billion dollars.

202
00:07:40,567 --> 00:07:42,212
On the first day of trading,

203
00:07:42,212 --> 00:07:44,086
