204
00:07:44,086 --> 00:07:45,727
sixty-six percent.

205
00:07:45,867 --> 00:07:48,097
That made it the most valuable company

206
00:07:48,097 --> 00:07:49,698
listed in mainland China,

207
00:07:49,698 --> 00:07:51,117
worth more than four hundred and

208
00:07:51,117 --> 00:07:53,947
eighty-seven billion dollars on paper.

209
00:07:54,227 --> 00:07:56,245
Investors were betting that a fourth

210
00:07:56,245 --> 00:07:58,262
seller would get rich from the shortage

211
00:07:58,262 --> 00:07:59,086
too.

212
00:07:59,350 --> 00:08:01,650
But CXMT has a problem.

213
00:08:01,650 --> 00:08:04,634
Its access to advanced chipmaking tools is

214
00:08:04,634 --> 00:08:05,604
restricted,

215
00:08:05,604 --> 00:08:08,587
and some American lawmakers have called

216
00:08:08,587 --> 00:08:11,074
