217
00:08:11,074 --> 00:08:12,420
memory.

218
00:08:12,730 --> 00:08:15,033
The research firm Counterpoint forecasts

219
00:08:15,033 --> 00:08:17,565
its share at about eleven percent by

220
00:08:17,565 --> 00:08:18,694
twenty twenty-eight,

221
00:08:18,694 --> 00:08:20,996
and estimates it would need at least

222
00:08:20,996 --> 00:08:23,759
fifteen percent to be competitive in the

223
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:24,820
