224
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:26,209
A challenger,

225
00:08:26,209 --> 00:08:27,040
yes.

226
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:28,777
A rescue for buyers,

227
00:08:28,777 --> 00:08:30,062
not yet.

228
00:08:30,317 --> 00:08:32,827
So is this the new normal?

229
00:08:33,007 --> 00:08:35,931
Memory has a very long history of

230
00:08:35,931 --> 00:08:38,724
