236
00:09:02,168 --> 00:09:03,003
spree.

237
00:09:03,233 --> 00:09:04,460
In one quarter,

238
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:06,714
Micron's revenue fell from seven point

239
00:09:06,714 --> 00:09:09,219
