274
00:10:19,168 --> 00:10:21,731
expect balance before the second half of

275
00:10:21,731 --> 00:10:23,263
twenty twenty-eight.

276
00:10:23,553 --> 00:10:24,434
These are forecasts,

277
00:10:24,434 --> 00:10:24,953
not facts.

278
00:10:24,953 --> 00:10:27,328
TeamGroup even expects the tightest months

279
00:10:27,328 --> 00:10:28,254
